{"name": "PEAK MALE FANTASY", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPEAK MALE FANTASY is a brutal horde-survival action RPG for 1-4 players in online co-op. Fight thousands of monsters at once, take down massive bosses, and grow stronger every run. All progression is persistent.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5297250/extras/232bde737b632dacd941bd2510461bc8.poster.avif?t=1795194452\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5297250/extras/232bde737b632dacd941bd2510461bc8.webm?t=1795194452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5297250/extras/232bde737b632dacd941bd2510461bc8.mp4?t=1795194452\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5297250/extras/aa69fb1053054db0b13219a774bd24e3.avif?t=1795194452\" width=\"1170\"/></span><br/>Fight endless hordes solo or with up to 3 friends in online co-op. Every hero has their own skills to wipe them out.<br/><br/><strong>Up to 200,000 enemies on screen at once.</strong><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5297250/extras/64abc64a4c3486d4eafb47d53305fd6d.poster.avif?t=1795194452\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5297250/extras/64abc64a4c3486d4eafb47d53305fd6d.webm?t=1795194452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app